      {
        "id": "equipment-list",
        "steps": [
          "Add a panel or import an equipment-list workbook (panel sheets become tabs, Brand sheets the catalogue)",
          "Build the catalogue: import a catalogue workbook or read a PDF/image datasheet and tick the verified rows",
          "Enter KKS, description, duty and consumed load; pick Brand, Model and Configuration to fill the rest. KSS headings are also accepted on import.",
          "Adjust each panel's operating factors and design margin; read the panel and plant load",
          "Search across panels and compare a candidate model or load",
          "Export panel sheets with the template's six-row heading, four added equipment columns, operating-factor summary, live formulas and landscape print layout, or Send to cable sizing (From = panel, To = description, G = rated input power). The template's intermittent reactive operating-factor formula uses the largest load, so export totals may differ from the website."
        ],
        "modules": [
