      "role": "Pure image helpers for drawings (plain RGBA arrays, linear in pixels): luminance, Otsu threshold, ink mask, line mask that ignores strongly coloured mark-ups, letter stem height measured from vertical run lengths, straight-stroke detection with thickness, box detection (breaker/symbol outlines found before lines are erased) and outline erasing, OCR clean image with long lines erased, quarter-turn rotation and mapping of rotated word boxes, and feeder tracing: busbars are long horizontal strokes with feeders (two if heavier than other long lines, else three; twice-bent cable routes rejected), feeders are followed through bends and across symbol gaps (breakers, fuses, coils) using an endpoint grid. Limits: 8,000 strokes, 60 busbars, 1,500 feeders.",
