      "role": "Browser reader for schematics: pdf.js text with page rotation and text direction, OCR (sparse-text mode) for pages without a text layer or for images, UTF-8/Windows-1252 DXF decoding, cancel support, 25 MB/page/text-item limits, image header dimension check before decoding, friendly pdf.js and DWG messages. Images and scanned PDF pages go through drawing-ocr (scale up to 2x for small screenshots, 24 MP working budget); vector PDF pages are rendered to trace busbars and feeders under the text layer. Returns the text read for the review.",
